OL,3,GNEWSADeveloper left estate unfinished,
OL,4,Acouncillors say
OL,5,
OL,6,FA developer has built a housing estate
OL,7,Fwithout delivering promised extras,
OL,8,Fcouncillors have said.
OL,10,FCala Homes built 220 homes on the site
OL,11,Fof the former Alton Brewery in
OL,12,FHampshire after winning planning
OL,13,Fpermission in 2020.
OL,15,FHowever, it has not completed the
OL,16,Fdevelopment and has left some elements
OL,17,Fin an "unacceptable condition",
OL,18,Faccording to members of East Hampshire
OL,19,FDistrict Council.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
